{"steam_appid":2161430,"steam_name":"FAKE SIGNALS","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2161430/498242/276622fb0320ad6155fcef7bf25f915ed13ac755/1751083806/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1668653337","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256906996/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1668653337","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/ss_6ae084fef90c390f1f66533ee92518602ce2c5e3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749785241","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/ss_13aacde2a2944183fcddb530dc5930c8fb8cbbc4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749785241","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/ss_1dc17d132a07128202379311a45b33cf9ed94cc0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749785241","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/ss_7498d0c8ac2fda5bc9d1b021e10f187d585bc1c9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749785241","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/ss_ae7d0d649e22e760016ea4628b8e8aacbbd8e257.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749785241"],"about_the_game":"FAKE SIGNALS is an action hybrid rogue-lite that you sneak in the enemies' camps, get various weapons and eliminate them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/extras/36a3c5957e2211ba56784bd508205d9a.poster.avif?t=1749785241\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/extras/36a3c5957e2211ba56784bd508205d9a.webm?t=1749785241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/extras/36a3c5957e2211ba56784bd508205d9a.mp4?t=1749785241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Feature</h2>• Clear 27 missions in 3 themes.<br><br>• Use 20+ different weapons.<br>• Utilize various interactive objects.<br>• Enemies have a variety of AI and Weapons. Get rid of them. <br>• Earn coins to unlock navigation apps.<br>• Don't be afraid of death. Your chance to revenge will come immediately.<br><br>Use weapons such as melee weapons, ranged weapons, throwing weapons, mines, explosive barrel, etc. and defeat enemies.<br>Depending on which weapon you choose and which route you choose, you can have different experiences.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/extras/84ba405c72aa7bfaec45ee13883319da.poster.avif?t=1749785241\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/extras/84ba405c72aa7bfaec45ee13883319da.webm?t=1749785241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/extras/84ba405c72aa7bfaec45ee13883319da.mp4?t=1749785241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Find objects you can hide in. There will be enemies' weapons.<br>Turn on &amp; off the lights, and you can sometimes destroy them.<br>Complete missions by using interactive objects such as controllable elevators and doors that open &amp; close.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/extras/998ac5e02eb988456a65543f50803b9c.poster.avif?t=1749785241\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/extras/998ac5e02eb988456a65543f50803b9c.webm?t=1749785241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/extras/998ac5e02eb988456a65543f50803b9c.mp4?t=1749785241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In-car navigation has a lot of information to help you play fake signals.<br>Information is about each stage, weapons, mails from the helper, soundtracks, bonus stages, etc.<br>Some apps can be unlocked by earning coins.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/extras/a2f83209aa889c080905b9c8cbdbbb0c.poster.avif?t=1749785241\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/extras/a2f83209aa889c080905b9c8cbdbbb0c.webm?t=1749785241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161430/extras/a2f83209aa889c080905b9c8cbdbbb0c.mp4?t=1749785241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX11<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX11<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie"],"developers":["Vona Soft"],"publishers":["Vona Soft"],"release_date":"24 May, 2023"}